  "id": "death-anxiety-scales",
  "term": "death-anxiety scales",
  "definition": "Death-anxiety scales are measures used to assess how much death anxiety a person has. In this context, death anxiety means fear and anxious distress related to thoughts of one’s own death or the death of relatives.",
